        <section class="admin-section password-box admin-panel-view" id="adminSecurityPanel" data-admin-panel="security">
            <h3>🔐 Admin Password</h3>
            <p>For security, set or rotate <code>ADMIN_PASSWORD</code> in your Render environment variables, then redeploy. Do not store administrator passwords in the database.</p>
            <div class="admin-security-grid"><div><strong>Session protection</strong><span>Signed, HTTP-only session cookie. HTTPS secure mode is enabled in production.</span></div><div><strong>Form protection</strong><span>Admin POST actions require a session-bound CSRF token.</span></div><div><strong>Login protection</strong><span>Admin login is rate-limited. Use a unique 16+ character password.</span></div><div><strong>Secrets</strong><span>Keep Supabase service-role key, session secret, AI and provider API keys in Render Environment only.</span></div><div><strong>Data safety</strong><span>Back up Supabase before schema updates. The V23 migration is additive and does not delete orders or products.</span></div></div>
        </section>
